installation and maintenance with minimal disruption to store operations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I update pricing and promotional content in real-time?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the ShelfEdge COB uses WiFi real-time CMS to instantly update pricing, promotions, or video content, ensuring dynamic pricing accuracy throughout your retail environment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to traditional paper shelf tags?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike paper tags, this LED display is ultra-thin, moisture and shock resistant, and allows dynamic, real-time pricing updates, which can increase retail conversions by up to 35% through improved customer engagement.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the power consumption for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Each module consumes only 8 watts, making the ShelfEdge COB highly energy-efficient while maintaining a brightness of 1,500 nits for excellent visibility.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of environments can the ShelfEdge COB display withstand?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display is built with shock and moisture resistance, making it suitable for high-traffic retail environments such as supermarkets and pharmacies where durability is critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and lifespan can I expect?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The ShelfEdge COB offers a long lifespan of up to 50,000 hours, backed by manufacturer warranty terms specific to your purchase, ensuring reliable operation over many years.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this display suitable for all retail environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is ideal for supermarkets, large retail chains, and pharmacies due to its compact form factor, dynamic content capability, and durable design tailored for frequent price updates and customer interaction.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"ShelfEdge COB 1.2mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-shf120\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>ShelfEdge COB 1.2mm</h1><p>Discover ShelfEdge COB 1.2mm LED display in Dubai. Perfect for retail shelves. Contact Brightluxx UAE for premium LED solutions today!</p><p><strong>Digital shelf tags. Dynamic pricing. Real-time.</strong></p><p>Ultra-thin 25mm COB shelf-edge LED display replacing traditional price tags and paper signage. Real-time content updates via WiFi for dynamic pricing, promotions, and video. Proven to increase retail conversion by 35%. Moisture and shock-resistant for high-traffic environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the ShelfEdge COB 1.2mm display?</h3><p>The ShelfEdge COB 1.2mm features a pixel pitch of 1.25mm, delivering crisp, high-resolution visuals ideal for close-range viewing on retail shelves.</p><h3>How is the display mounted and installed?</h3><p>The display installs easily using a clip-on rail mount system that fits standard shelf edges, enabling quick installation and maintenance with minimal disruption to store operations.</p><h3>Can I update pricing and promotional content in real-time?</h3><p>Yes, the ShelfEdge COB uses WiFi real-time CMS to instantly update pricing, promotions, or video content, ensuring dynamic pricing accuracy throughout your retail environment.</p><h3>How does this product compare to traditional paper shelf tags?</h3><p>Unlike paper tags, this LED display is ultra-thin, moisture and shock resistant, and allows dynamic, real-time pricing updates, which can increase retail conversions by up to 35% through improved customer engagement.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2