\", \"description\": \"Ultra-thin 25mm COB shelf-edge LED display replacing traditional price tags and paper signage. Real-time content updates via WiFi for dynamic pricing, promotions, and video. Proven to increase retail conversion by 35%. Moisture and shock-resistant for high-traffic environments.\", \"sku\": \"BL-SHF120\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-shf120\", \"category\": \"shelf-edge\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-shf120.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 200, \"highPrice\": 1500, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-shf120\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.25mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"300 x 60 per module\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta42,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the ShelfEdge COB 1.2mm display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The ShelfEdge COB 1.2mm features a pixel pitch of 1.25mm, delivering crisp, high-resolution visuals ideal for close-range viewing on retail shelves.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the display mounted and installed?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display installs easily using a clip-on rail mount system that fits standard shelf edges, enabling quick installation and maintenance with minimal disruption to store operations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I update pricing and promotional content in real-time?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the ShelfEdge COB uses WiFi real-time CMS to instantly update pricing, promotions, or video content, ensuring dynamic pricing accuracy throughout your retail environment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to traditional paper shelf tags?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike paper tags, this LED display is ultra-thin, moisture and shock resistant, and allows dynamic, real-time pricing updates, which can increase retail conversions by up to 35% through improved customer engagement.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the power consumption for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Each module consumes only 8 watts, making the ShelfEdge COB highly energy-efficient while maintaining a brightness of 1,500 nits for excellent visibility.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of environments can the ShelfEdge COB display withstand?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display is built with shock and moisture resistance, making it suitable for high-traffic retail environments such as supermarkets and pharmacies where durability is critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and lifespan can I expect?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The ShelfEdge COB offers a long lifespan of up to 50,000 hours, backed by manufacturer warranty terms specific to your purchase, ensuring reliable operation over many years.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Questio